{"id": "under-ten-million-then-amended", "title": "Contracts set just under the $10M Board line, then amended far past it", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.157, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "5774ab62247c64f1", "words": 390, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In San Francisco, contracts of 10 million dollars or more need a Board of Supervisors vote.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.21, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes at $10 million or more"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "Charter section 9.118"}, "emph": ["10 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.24, 0.8, 1.26, 1.34, 1.47, 1.75, 2.04, 2.19, 2.46, 2.72, 2.79, 2.98, 3.07, 3.69]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Smaller ones, a department signs alone.", "t0": 4.33, "t1": 6.42, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes at $10 million or more"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "Charter section 9.118"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.44, 0.89, 0.96, 1.33, 1.66]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "So how many City contracts sit just under that line,", "t0": 6.54, "t1": 10.06, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Just under the line", "sub": "$9.5 million to $9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.39, 0.61, 0.9, 1.62, 2.02, 2.42, 2.83, 3.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "oneLine"], "text": "within half a million of it?", "t0": 10.06, "t1": 11.77, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Just under the line", "sub": "$9.5 million to $9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 0.59, 0.67, 1.04, 1.24]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "364.", "t0": 11.77, "t1": 14.43, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "364", "label": "contracts from $9.5M to just under $10M"}, "emph": ["364"], "wt": [0.04, 1.57, 1.89]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 14.95, "t1": 16.59, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.14, 0.28, 0.36, 0.48, 0.98, 1.12, 1.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "And just over the line, up to 10.5 million? Only 39.", "t0": 16.71, "t1": 20.55, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "emph": ["39"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.42, 0.6, 0.71, 1.11, 1.25, 1.38, 1.53, 1.79, 1.95, 2.73, 3.05]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "If need alone set the size, as many would land above as below.", "t0": 20.67, "t1": 24.3, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.5, 0.84, 1.03, 1.21, 1.66, 1.81, 2.05, 2.22, 2.51, 2.97, 3.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Nine times as many land below.", "t0": 24.42, "t1": 26.43, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["just under: $9.5M to $9,999,999", "364"], "b": ["just over: $10M to $10.5M", "39"]}, "emph": ["Nine times"], "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.67, 0.83, 1.19, 1.58]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "amount"], "text": "23 contracts sit at exactly 9,999,999 dollars.", "t0": 26.55, "t1": 29.88, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,999,999", "label": "the amount on 23 City contracts", "sub": "one dollar under the Board line"}, "emph": ["23"], "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 1.11, 1.38, 1.58, 2.05, 2.33, 2.52, 2.82]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "In July 2025,", "t0": 30.5, "t1": 31.92, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "the homelessness department signed DISH SF for one year:", "t0": 31.92, "t1": 35.04, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.61, 1.15, 1.46, 1.87, 2.15, 2.36, 2.6, 2.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "9,995,897 dollars.", "t0": 35.04, "t1": 36.43, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "DISH SF", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "chip": "$9,995,897"}, "emph": ["9,995,897"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.51, 0.82]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "Eleven months later, the Board raised it. To what?", "t0": 36.55, "t1": 39.27, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-07-01", "to": "2026-06-05", "days": "339", "fromLab": "signed under the line", "toLab": "Board raises it", "kicker": "The first lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.58, 0.98, 1.13, 1.41, 1.75, 2.21, 2.33]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "25.4 million dollars.", "t0": 39.27, "t1": 42.12, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,361,109", "label": "Resolution 321-26"}, "emph": ["25.4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.92, 1.33, 1.69, 2.29]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[3]"], "text": "How did it fit under? Its cushion for overruns was 8.4 percent. The department’s standard is 15.", "t0": 42.64, "t1": 49.07, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["DISH SF contingency", "about 8.4%"], "b": ["the department’s standard", "15%"]}, "emph": ["8.4 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.24, 0.37, 0.53, 1.25, 1.55, 1.89, 2.06, 2.69, 2.92, 3.09, 3.41, 3.57, 4.12, 4.53, 5.24, 5.57, 5.86]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "At 15 percent, it would have needed a Board vote from day one.", "t0": 49.19, "t1": 52.09, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["DISH SF contingency", "about 8.4%"], "b": ["the department’s standard", "15%"]}, "emph": ["day one"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 1.06, 1.12, 1.2, 1.34, 1.59, 1.69, 1.92, 2.17, 2.33, 2.58]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "St. Vincent de Paul runs the Division Circle Navigation Center.", "t0": 52.31, "t1": 55.33, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Division Circle Navigation Center", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "St. Vincent de Paul Society of SF"}, "wt": [0.09, 0.31, 0.58, 0.69, 1.02, 1.26, 1.35, 1.71, 2.05, 2.6]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "It costs about 8 million dollars a year, built to run ten years.", "t0": 55.45, "t1": 58.63, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Division Circle Navigation Center", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "St. Vincent de Paul Society of SF"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.62, 0.72, 1.06, 1.37, 1.48, 1.89, 2.09, 2.2, 2.48, 2.74]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Its first contract covered one year, at 9,546,685 dollars.", "t0": 58.75, "t1": 62.27, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "One year, options through June 2035", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$9,546,685"}, "emph": ["one year"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.45, 0.86, 1.2, 1.36, 1.74, 1.84, 2.09, 2.26, 2.58, 2.73, 3.09]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The Board voted once the operator was in place.", "t0": 62.39, "t1": 65.15, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "One year, options through June 2035", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$9,546,685"}, "wt": [0.14, 0.35, 0.69, 0.97, 1.21, 1.31, 1.73, 1.93, 2.08]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[4]"], "text": "37.1 million dollars.", "t0": 65.27, "t1": 67.96, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$37.1 million", "label": "Resolution 322-26, June 5, 2026"}, "emph": ["37.1"], "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.99, 1.33, 2.01]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[7]"], "text": "Abode Services has a ceiling of 9,999,999 dollars.", "t0": 68.58, "t1": 71.5, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Abode Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Fiscal Agent - Prevention", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.8, 0.93, 1.02, 1.43, 1.57, 1.83, 1.98, 2.34]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[7]"], "text": "What did the department budget under it?", "t0": 71.62, "t1": 73.14, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Abode Services", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "Fiscal Agent - Prevention", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.19, 0.28, 0.71, 1.04, 1.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "16.1 million dollars.", "t0": 73.14, "t1": 74.99, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,127,661", "label": "budgeted, FY2023-24 to FY2026-27"}, "emph": ["16.1"], "wt": [0.04, 0.58, 0.89, 0.98, 1.34]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Spending planned past the line, under a cap one dollar below it.", "t0": 75.51, "t1": 78.5, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Planned past the line", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "$29,062,174 requested on Oct 1, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.67, 0.87, 1.04, 1.44, 1.7, 1.81, 2.06, 2.26, 2.54, 2.82]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation was signed without bidding while on the Controller’s watch list.", "t0": 78.72, "t1": 83.47, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation", "sub": "$9,989,926, Controller Tier 3"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Conard House", "sub": "$9,997,681, newly Tier 2"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "No bidding", "sub": "Administrative Code Chapter 21B"}], "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.17, 0.37, 0.66, 0.94, 1.49, 1.7, 2.04, 2.39, 2.82, 3.24, 3.39, 3.49, 4.04, 4.33]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Conard House, also unbid, joined the list that December.", "t0": 83.59, "t1": 86.96, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation", "sub": "$9,989,926, Controller Tier 3"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Conard House", "sub": "$9,997,681, newly Tier 2"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "No bidding", "sub": "Administrative Code Chapter 21B"}], "kicker": "The fourth lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.9, 1.25, 1.94, 2.25, 2.36, 2.62, 2.83]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why"], "text": "At a Board hearing, the analyst reports that status. Under the line, that step was skipped.", "t0": 87.08, "t1": 91.75, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The step that was skipped", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "a contractor’s monitoring status, reported at a Board hearing"}, "emph": ["skipped"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.21, 0.48, 0.87, 0.97, 1.39, 1.78, 1.97, 2.63, 2.95, 3.07, 3.5, 3.89, 4.14, 4.29]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]"], "text": "In November, the Board adopted Conard House’s rise; Bayview’s is listed as passed, Abode’s pending.", "t0": 91.87, "t1": 97.48, "shot": "b19a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Conard House, File 26-1043, adopted Nov 3, 2026", "sub": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation listed as passed; Abode Services pending in committee", "chip": "$32,803,756"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.5, 0.59, 0.81, 1.23, 1.56, 1.95, 2.82, 3.23, 3.37, 3.73, 3.93, 4.77, 5.18]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[5]", "established[6]", "established[13]"], "text": "Line them up. Mid-Market Foundation began at 9 million in July 2022, with no Board vote.", "t0": 97.7, "t1": 103.37, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Started under $10 million. Now:", "rows": [["Mid-Market Foundation, $9.0 million", "$68.85 million"], ["Tenderloin Housing Clinic, $9,990,000", "$42.5 million"], ["St. Vincent de Paul, $9,546,685", "$37.1 million"], ["DISH SF, $9,995,897", "$25.4 million"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.32, 0.72, 1.61, 2.1, 2.37, 2.52, 2.79, 3.13, 3.3, 3.62, 3.94, 4.51, 4.77, 5.01, 5.36]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "It’s now 68.85 million.", "t0": 103.49, "t1": 105.85, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Started under $10 million. Now:", "rows": [["Mid-Market Foundation, $9.0 million", "$68.85 million"], ["Tenderloin Housing Clinic, $9,990,000", "$42.5 million"], ["St. Vincent de Paul, $9,546,685", "$37.1 million"], ["DISH SF, $9,995,897", "$25.4 million"]]}, "emph": ["68.85 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.41, 0.96, 1.27, 1.45, 1.79]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[9]"], "text": "No auditor or analyst says any amount was set to dodge a vote.", 